":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza"},{"imgId":"hilton-mendoza-i29","z":1,"panX":0,"panY":0,"kind":"carousel","caption":"Tu pausa, a tu manera.\nEn Hilton Mendoza, cada momento de bienestar empieza por darte tiempo para vos.\n\nConsultá las experiencias del spa.\n#HiltonMendoza #Spa","likes":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza","carouselIds":["hilton-mendoza-i29","hilton-mendoza-g55"]},{"imgId":"hilton-mendoza-i48","z":1,"panX":0,"panY":0,"kind":"photo","caption":"Una tarde que merece su tiempo.\nCompartí una pausa con la propuesta de té de la tarde de Hilton Mendoza.\n\nConsultá disponibilidad y opciones vigentes.\n#HiltonMendoza","likes":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza"},{"imgId":"hilton-mendoza-g66","z":1,"panX":0,"panY":0,"kind":"carousel","caption":"Otra mirada sobre el mismo lugar.\nLa arquitectura y la luz también forman parte de la experiencia Hilton Mendoza.\n\n#HiltonMendoza #Mendoza","likes":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza","carouselIds":["hilton-mendoza-g66","hilton-mendoza-g12"]},{"imgId":"hilton-mendoza-i3","z":1,"panX":0,"panY":0,"kind":"carousel","caption":"Descansar también es parte del viaje.\nHabitaciones pensadas para acompañar tu estadía en Mendoza.\n\nConocé las categorías y reservá desde el enlace del perfil.\n#HiltonMendoza","likes":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza","carouselIds":["hilton-mendoza-i3","hilton-mendoza-g15","hilton-mendoza-g13"]},{"imgId":"hilton-mendoza-i20","z":1,"panX":0,"panY":0,"kind":"carousel","caption":"Agua, luz y un cambio de ritmo.\nUn recorrido por la piscina cubierta de Hilton Mendoza.\n\n#HiltonMendoza #Bienestar","likes":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza","carouselIds":["hilton-mendoza-i20","hilton-mendoza-g50","hilton-mendoza-g52"]},{"imgId":"hilton-mendoza-i47","z":1,"panX":0,"panY":0,"kind":"carousel","caption":"Espacios que invitan a mirar hacia arriba.\nUn recorrido por la arquitectura, la luz y los lugares de encuentro de Hilton Mendoza.\n\n#HiltonMendoza","likes":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza","carouselIds":["hilton-mendoza-i47","hilton-mendoza-g72","hilton-mendoza-g61"]},{"imgId":"hilton-mendoza-i2","z":1,"panX":0,"panY":0,"kind":"carousel","caption":"Un brindis, distintas formas de disfrutarlo.\nDescubrí las propuestas del Pool Bar y La Barrica en Hilton Mendoza.\n\nConsultá horarios y disponibilidad.\n#HiltonMendoza","likes":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza","carouselIds":["hilton-mendoza-i2","hilton-mendoza-g40"]},{"imgId":"hilton-mendoza-i25","z":1,"panX":0,"panY":0,"kind":"carousel","caption":"Calor, silencio y tiempo para vos.\nEl sauna forma parte del recorrido de bienestar de Hilton Mendoza.\n\nConsultá las opciones de acceso al spa.\n#HiltonMendoza #Spa","likes":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza","carouselIds":["hilton-mendoza-i25","hilton-mendoza-g56"]},{"imgId":"hilton-mendoza-i36","z":1,"panX":0,"panY":0,"kind":"carousel","caption":"Un espacio para quedarte un poco más.\nDetalles que acompañan tus momentos de descanso y de trabajo en Hilton Mendoza.\n\n#HiltonMendoza #Habitaciones","likes":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza","carouselIds":["hilton-mendoza-i36","hilton-mendoza-g30","hilton-mendoza-g22"]},{"imgId":"hilton-mendoza-i9","z":1,"panX":0,"panY":0,"kind":"photo","caption":"Las mejores conversaciones también tienen su mesa.\nUna tarde para compartir en La Barrica, Hilton Mendoza.\n\nConsultá las propuestas vigentes.\n#HiltonMendoza #LaBarrica","likes":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza"},{"imgId":"hilton-mendoza-i13","z":1,"panX":0,"panY":0,"kind":"carousel","caption":"Dejá que el día vaya un poco más lento.\nEl jacuzzi y los espacios de descanso te esperan en el spa de Hilton Mendoza.\n\n#HiltonMendoza #Bienestar","likes":"0","comments":"0","date":"","location":"Hilton Mendoza","carouselIds":["hilton-men